  "contentHtml": "<p>새로 옮긴 학교의 과학실 복도가 썰렁해서</p><p>식물생태원^^ 을 만들어 보았습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>특이한 식물 몇 종을 구입하고,</p><p>안내문(탐구질문)을 만들었구요.</p><p><br></p><p>학생들이 질문을 만들어서 붙일 수 있는 공간도 만들어 보았습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>바쁜 하루, 식물 보시면서 힐링 하세요~</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/990D98485F0FFE5727\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"639\" height=\"343\" style=\"width: 639px; height: 343px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20200716_160951839.jpg\"  id=\"A_990D98485F0FFE5727704E\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993DA5475F0FFE7B27\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 360px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20200716_160952366.jpg\"  id=\"A_993DA5475F0FFE7B27DAA5\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991535505F0FFF131E\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"329\" height=\"624\" style=\"width: 329px; height: 624px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"540\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20200716_160952074.jpg\"  id=\"A_991535505F0FFF131E9050\"/><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994622485F0FFE572B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"364\" height=\"647\" style=\"width: 364px; height: 647px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"540\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20200716_160951328.jpg\"  id=\"A_994622485F0FFE572B6EF4\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9995BB485F0FFE562B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"540\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"540\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20200716_160952936.jpg\"  id=\"A_9995BB485F0FFE562B44FD\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">---------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">전시한 식물 설명판입니다. </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">A4로 출력해서 상장케이스에 넣어서 전시했습니다.<br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D202%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20200716162158&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile286.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F990CB7475F10EF831F325E')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 몬스테라.hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D202%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20200716162158&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile258.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F990C4D475F10EF831F2F54')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 미모사,후마타고사리.hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D202%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20200716162158&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile268.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F990CB3475F10EF831F0FDD')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 수염틸란드시아.hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3D424t%26dataid%3D202%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20200716162158&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile252.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F990D16475F10EF841F9C23')\"><img src=\"https